            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A02-K5130, Colonial Door Knocker with Urn Tip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Solid Brass Colonial Door Knocker has a traditional style. It features a urn tip that adds a bit of elegant detail. Made out of solid brass, measures 6 inches high. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door knocker has a standard thru-bolt mount and comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Urn Tip Traditional Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>\r\n** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/knockers\">Door Knockers</a>\r\n</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
